  "visualInspection": [
    "Purple tall tractor cab, framed blue glass, restrained silver grille and two slim fixed stacks read separately from the much longer cream box trailer with broad teal stripe. Stack tops remain below trailer roof.",
    "The side gap between cab and trailer is visibly open above a low gray fifth-wheel plate and dark frame bridge. Fixed saddle and short visual kingpin connect those low components to frame/trailer; actual gap and plate/frame/saddle triangle rays independently qualify the geometry.",
    "All three near-side axles read as real tires with silver hubs. Far crowns remain beneath real cab arches or broad trailer underside/gray guards in both camera families; no floating cap-only cover or exposed crown spill was observed.",
    "Cab skin glass/frames and trailer cream/teal/roof/end-door paint have distinct actual UV owners. No overlaid glass sheets, view-dependent paint, logos, tiny text or transparent surfaces were observed.",
    "All32 final native views have zero border pixels. Expanded288/radius144 padding retains shared centered128 crop parity at all16 game headings. Both224 and256 centered viewports would clip portions of the measured final extents; no rescale or vehicle-origin move was used.",
    "All4 actual cardinals fit standard192x224 origin96,144 by translation(-48,0), with every occupiedRGBA pixel exact. Rear-facing cardinal reachesY218 exclusive and retains6px bottom padding.",
    "All6 independent quarter/reverse/pivot/reset controls pass while the entire cab/trailer/frame/coupling/stack body remains fixed. Signed phase contacts and both actual wireframes were inspected. No articulated joint or separate trailer body is present.",
    "Large quiet cream trailer faces and thin diagonal grille/frame/door edges retain ordinary native-pixel aliasing. End-on headings naturally occlude the coupling space and far wheels; physical gap evidence does not imply visibility from every camera."
  ],
